{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51710","headline":"嶮竿歌 · 冯涓","name":"嶮竿歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山嶮惊摧车，水嶮怕覆舟。\n奈何平地不肯立，沿上百尺高竿头。\n我不知尔是人耶猿耶复猱耶，教我见尔爲尔长叹嗟。\n我闻孝子不许国，我闻忠臣不忧家。\n尔即轻命重黄金，忠孝全亏徒尔夸。\n常将嶮艺悦君目，终日贪心媚君禄。\n百尺高竿百度沿，一足参差一家哭。\n嶮竿儿，听我语，更有嶮竿嶮於汝。\n解从上处失君恩，落向天涯海边去。\n嶮竿儿，尔须知，嶮处欲往宜尔思。\n上得欲下下不得，我谓此辈嶮於嶮竿儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯涓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51710.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51710","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}